# Output Rail — validates the Agent Core's response before it reaches the
# Customer (CONTEXT.md's "Output Rail").
#
# Redefines NeMo's built-in `self check output` flow under its own name for
# the same reason as ../rails/input.co: keep the Output Rail's actual logic
# readable from this repo rather than NeMo's library source. Runs the
# `self_check_output` action (an LLM call using the `self_check_output`
# prompt in ../config.yml) against the Agent Core's already-generated reply;
# if it says the response should be blocked, the Customer gets a refusal
# instead of the raw reply.
define flow self check output
  $allowed = execute self_check_output

  if not $allowed
    bot refuse to respond
    stop
